{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Frozen Geode is a ",["l","矿物","Mineral"]," deposit that contains ",["l","矿物","minerals"],", ",["l","古物","artifacts"],", ores, or basic resources. It can be found on floors 41 to 79 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", on ",["l","农场","the Farm"]," in the ",["l","冬季","Winter"],", or inside a ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chest"],". It can also be received as a gift at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". An ",["l","冰柱鱼","Ice Pip"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," may produce 1 or 5 Frozen Geodes when the population of the pond reaches 9. Frozen Geodes can also be obtained by pickaxing ",["l","采矿#Frozen Geode Node","Frozen Geode Nodes"],". These are found in the small quarry on the ",["l","农场地图#Hilltop","Hill-top Farm"]," and ",["l","农场地图#Four Corners","Four Corners Farm"],". ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]," sells Frozen Geodes in his ",["l","沙漠节#Villager Shops","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 10 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s."]],["p",["The Frozen Geode can be broken open by ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," in the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith shop"]," for 25g or by using a ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],"."]],["p",["Neither daily ",["l","运气","luck"]," nor luck ",["l","效果","buffs"]," affect the contents of a Frozen Geode."]]]],["Frozen Geode Contents",2,[]],["Artifacts",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Ancient_Drum.png",24]],[["l","古代鼓","Ancient Drum"]],["1/30"]]]]]],["Foraged Minerals",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Frozen_Tear.png",24]],[["l","泪晶","Frozen Tear"]],["1/16"]]]]]],["Geode Minerals",3,[["p",["All Geode Minerals have a 1/30 chance to appear."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]}],[[["f","Aerinite.png",24]],[["l","青泥石","Aerinite"]]],[[["f","Esperite.png",24]],[["l","硅钙石","Esperite"]]],[[["f","Fairy_Stone.png",24]],[["l","精灵石","Fairy Stone"]]],[[["f","Fluorapatite.png",24]],[["l","氟磷灰石","Fluorapatite"]]],[[["f","Geminite.png",24]],[["l","杰明石","Geminite"]]],[[["f","Ghost_Crystal.png",24]],[["l","幽灵水晶","Ghost Crystal"]]],[[["f","Hematite.png",24]],[["l","赤铁矿","Hematite"]]],[[["f","Kyanite.png",24]],[["l","蓝晶石","Kyanite"]]],[[["f","Lunarite.png",24]],[["l","酸性月岩","Lunarite"]]],[[["f","Marble.png",24]],[["l","大理石","Marble"]]],[[["f","Ocean_Stone.png",24]],[["l","海洋石","Ocean Stone"]]],[[["f","Opal.png",24]],[["l","猫眼石","Opal"]]],[[["f","Pyrite.png",24]],[["l","黄铁矿","Pyrite"]]],[[["f","Soapstone.png",24]],[["l","皂石","Soapstone"]]]]]]],["Resources",3,[["p",["Note that ",["l","黄金矿石","Gold Ore"]," is available in the Frozen Geode only after the player has reached floor 76 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],". Before reaching floor 76, Iron Ore is substituted when breaking open a Frozen Geode. Except for clay and stone, the following items will be obtained in the following amounts: 30% for 1, 30% for 3, 30% for 5, 9% for 10, and 1% for 20. Stone has a 50% chance to use those values and a 50% chance to give only 1. Only 1 clay can be obtained from a single geode."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Stone.png",24]],[["l","石头","Stone"]],["1/8"]],[[["f","Clay.png",24]],[["l","粘土","Clay"]],["1/16"]],[[["f","Coal.png",24]],[["l","煤炭","Coal"]],["1/16"]],[[["f","Copper_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铜矿石","Copper Ore"]],["1/16"]],[[["f","Iron_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铁矿石","Iron Ore"]],["1/16"]],[[["f","Gold_Ore.png",24]],[["l","黄金矿石","Gold Ore"]],["1/16"]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Frozen Geode is used in the Bulletin Board."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Frozen Geode is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," with ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," in the feed to create a ",["l","裁缝","Blue Hoodie"],". It is a cyan dye when used in the spool of the Sewing Machine with a dyeable clothing item in the feed. It can be placed in the blue dye pot at Emily's and Haley's house for use in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Five Frozen Geodes may be requested by ",["l","冰柱鱼","Ice Pip"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 5 to 7."]],[1,["One Frozen Geode may be requested by several ocean fish in a ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 3 to 5."]],[1,["Five Frozen Geodes may be requested by the Raccoon at the ",["l","大树桩（地点）","Giant Stump"]," as part of his fifth request, or as part of any request starting with the sixth."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". Can be requested in ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quests"],". Can be produced by ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"s."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Can now be purchased at ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". May now be requested by the Raccoon."]]]]]]]}